    "notes": "PDAL 采用了核心+插件架构：核心库链接 GDAL/PROJ/ZLIB/GeoTIFF/CURL/Threads 等系统依赖，并通过 vendor 目录内嵌 Eigen/nanoflann/lazperf/arbiter/h3/kazhdan/lepcc/nlohmann/json-schema-validator/utfcpp 等 header-only 或小型库。另有 10+ 可选插件（plugins/）依赖 HDF5/Arrow/TileDB/Draco/PostgreSQL 等额外库。"
